      "text": "FDA's drug shortage list does not include granisetron hydrochloride as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East holds 204 tablets of the 1 mg presentation with a daily use of 7.6 tablets, providing 26.8 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D1"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale General holds 135 tablets of the 1 mg presentation with a daily use of 9.1 tablets, providing 14.9 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The product label for NDC 69452035001 identifies OrBion Pharmaceuticals Private Limited (FEI 3004540907) as the manufacturing plant, which was last inspected by FDA and classified NAI on 2025-10-27.",
      "cites": ["E7"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection records for that plant show four prior inspections classified VAI, with the most recent ending 2023-09-08 and known to FDA on 2023-10-11.",
      "cites": ["E3", "E4", "E5", "E6"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The rule-based alternate manufacturer option ranked 3 is to buy from Breckenridge Pharmaceutical, Inc., which is not on FDA's shortage list today and whose label names no plant we could place.",
